  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "多层窗帘令人喜爱的原因",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/10700",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=10700",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"10700\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "合适的窗帘装饰能够提升酒店客房的氛围，彰显酒店的品牌特色，并确保客人获得愉快的住宿体验。将透光窗帘与遮光窗帘搭配使用，既实用又个性。客人可以根据自己的喜好调节光线，而你也能打造出心仪的装饰效果。",
    "多层窗帘令人喜爱的原因"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20250116/9CD8D0BB-8C53-427D-A5AA42D2B80FF255.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20240925/EC66E05F-B641-4F9F-9034C6415D989337.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/10700",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20250116/9CD8D0BB-8C53-427D-A5AA42D2B80FF255.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20240925/EC66E05F-B641-4F9F-9034C6415D989337.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "酒店客房里，阳光透过大窗户照射进来，一个人站在深灰色KORGMOTT 库格莫特 遮光窗帘旁，遮光窗帘半遮着透光窗帘。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20250116/9CD8D0BB-8C53-427D-A5AA42D2B80FF255.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "酒店房间的窗户上挂着2幅薄薄的白色HILJA 茜利亚 窗帘和黄米色 ROSENMANDEL 洛森曼德 遮光窗帘。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20240925/EC66E05F-B641-4F9F-9034C6415D989337.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "cms-栅格合集 Curated Gallery-多层窗帘令人喜爱的原因"
   }
